// "BecomesTapped" = an object transitions untapped -> tapped ([CR#603.2e] —
// a "becomes" trigger fires only at the transition itself, not if the
// permanent enters the battlefield already tapped). Mirrors event/Attacks +
// event/Dies. Usage: BecomesTapped(what) — e.g. BecomesTapped(Type(Creature)),
// BecomesTapped(Ref(This)).
(
    name: "BecomesTapped",
    template: "${0} becomes tapped",
    kinds: [EventFilter],
    params: [Predicate],
    body: StateBecame(of: Param(0), becomes: Tapped),
)
